alue":"-m_{1}g\\cdot2R_{1}=\\frac{1}{2}m_{1}v_{C}^{2}-E_{k0}"},{"type":"text","value":"——1分\nC 点："},{"type":"math","value":"m_{1}g + F_{N} = m_{1}\\frac{v_{C}^{2}}{R_{1}}"},{"type":"text","value":"----1 分\n解得："},{"type":"math","value":"F_{N} = 30N"},{"type":"text","value":"----1 分\n（2）质量为"},{"type":"math","value":"m_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"的滑块在传送带全程加速，两物块碰撞过程中动能损失最大。----1分"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mu m_1 gL_1=\\frac{1}{2}m_1 v^2-E_{k0}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得 v=5m/s 1 分\n（3）如图所示，"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta v"},{"type":"text","value":"方向为物体所受合力方向，\n由作图可知，最小风力为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{1}{2}(m_{1}+m_{2})g"},{"type":"text","value":"----2分\n可知两物体从 G 点飞出后其最小速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\min} = v_{\\text{共}} \\cos 30^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":"\nI　当传送带的速度"},{"type":"math","value":"v \\geq 5m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"时，质量为"},{"type":"math","value":"m_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"的滑块从 F 到 G 过程，\n由动能定理："},{"type":"math","value":"-\\mu m_{1}gL_{2}=\\frac{1}{2}m_{1}v_{G}^{2}-\\frac{1}{2}m_{1}v_{F}^{2}"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/e60b854ef32400ba103df38fa1d8939ee0b7fb36bfff50c93021b6d1f602d081.png","width":339,"height":274,"width_mm":42.8},{"type":"text","value":"两滑块碰撞由动量守恒得："},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathrm{m}_{1}\\mathrm{v}_{\\mathrm{G}} = (\\mathrm{m}_{1} + \\mathrm{m}_{2})v_{\\text{共}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\text{共}} = 0.4m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"所以有"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\min}=v_{\\text{共}}\\cos30^{\\circ}=0.2\\sqrt{3}\\,\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\nII　出 F 后恰好运动到 G 点，"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{F}^{2}=2\\mu gL_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，解得此时"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{F}=3m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"当传送带的速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"3 \\, m/s < v < 5 \\, m/s"},{"type":"text","value":","},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\text{共}}' = 0.1 \\sqrt{v^{2} - 2 \\mu g L_{2}}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n故"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\min}=0.05\\sqrt{3(v^2-2\\mu gL_2)}"},{"type":"text","value":"----1 分\n综上分析：当"},{"type":"math","value":"v \\geq 5 \\, m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"时，"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\min}=0.2\\sqrt{3}\\,\\mathrm{m/s}"},{"type":"text","value":"当"},{"type":"math","value":"3 \\, m/s < v < 5 \\, m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"时，"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{\\min}=0.05\\sqrt{3(v^2-2\\mu gL_2)}=0.05\\sqrt{3(v^2-9)}"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--beidouxingmeng-2505-q17","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--beidouxingmeng-2505","source_question_id":"beidouxingmeng-2505-q17","number":"17","order":17,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"e669d78eac940a34bc0f3ee39ef40edd0cff03252c463ed2ecbd56fac76e2e6f","body":[{"type":"text","value":"17. （12分）如图所示，平行光滑的金属导轨由水平和左右两倾斜导轨组成，水平导轨与两侧倾斜导轨均有光滑绝缘圆弧轨道（长度可忽略）平滑相连。两侧倾斜导轨与水平面夹角均为 "},{"type":"math","value":"30^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。左侧倾斜导轨由间距 "},{"type":"math","value":"L"},{"type":"text","value":" 的导轨 "},{"type":"math","value":"CE"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"DF"},{"type":"text","value":" 构成，水平部分由两段足够长但不等宽的平行金属导轨连接构成，其中 "},{"type":"math","value":"EG"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"FH"},{"type":"text","value":" 段间距为 "},{"type":"math","value":"L"},{"type":"text","value":" ，有与竖直方向成 "},{"type":"math","value":"60^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" 斜向左上方的磁感应强度大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"2B"},{"type":"text","value":" 的匀强磁场。 "},{"type":"math","value":"MP"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"NQ"},{"type":"text","value":" 段间距为 "},{"type":"math","value":"2L"},{"type":"text","value":" ，有与竖直方向成 "},{"type":"math","value":"60^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":" 斜向右上方的磁感应强度大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"B"},{"type":"text","value":" 的匀强磁场。右侧足够长的倾斜导轨PK、QJ间距为 "},{"type":"math","value":"2L"},{"type":"text","value":" ，上端连接电容为C的电容器，有垂直右侧倾斜导轨平面向上的磁感应强度大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"5B"},{"type":"text","value":" 的匀强磁场。导体棒甲的质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"0.5m"},{"type":"text","value":" 、电阻为 "},{"type":"math","value":"R"},{"type":"text","value":" ，乙的质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":" 、电阻不计，导体棒乙静止于 "},{"type":"math","value":"MP"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"NQ"},{"type":"text","value":" 段。现使导体棒甲自斜面导轨上距水平导轨 "},{"type":"math","value":"h"},{"type":"text","value":" 高度处静止释放，两金属棒在运动过程中始终垂直导轨，且与导轨保持良好接触。若稳定时导体棒甲未进入 "},{"type":"math","value":"MP"},{"type":"text","value":" 、 "},{"type":"math","value":"NQ"},{"type":"text","value":" 段，导轨电阻和空气阻力均忽略不计。已知 "},{"type":"math","value":"B = 0.2T"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"m = 0.4kg"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"h = 0.45m"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"L = 0.2m"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"R = 0.3\\Omega"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"C = \\frac{5}{12}F"},{"type":"text","value":" ， "},{"type":"math","value":"g = 10m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。求：\n(1)甲棒刚进入磁场时，乙棒的加速度；\n(2)从甲棒进入磁场到两棒达到稳定的过程，通过乙棒的电量；\n(3)从甲棒进入磁场到两棒达到稳定的过程，回路产生的焦耳热；\n(4)稳定后，乙棒进入右侧倾斜轨道，随即撤去甲棒，求乙棒上滑的最大距离。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/d1dcf2d5902f7bca7835c953741f9121f488afd8dcee9e95bed2eba752921019.png","width":1268,"height":327,"width_mm":149.049,"row_group":"beidouxingmeng-2505-q17-row1"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"17.（1）甲棒刚进入磁场时，根据机械能守恒有"},{"type":"math","value":"0.5mgh = \\frac{1}{2} \\times 0.5m \\times v_{0}^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"----1 分\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0} = 3m/s"},{"type":"text","value":"甲棒感应电动势"},{"type":"math","value":"E = 2B\\cos60^{\\circ}Lv_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"----1 分\n电流"},{"type":"math","value":"I = \\frac{E}{R}"},{"type":"text","value":"对乙棒有"},{"type":"math","value":"2LB\\cos60^{\\circ}I = ma"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"a=0.04\\,\\mathrm{m/s^2}"},{"type":"text","value":"（1分）\n（2）当甲进入磁场，甲、乙所受安培力相等，有"},{"type":"math","value":"2\\mathrm{B}\\cos 60^{\\circ}\\mathrm{IL} = 2\\mathrm{LB}\\cos 60^{\\circ}\\mathrm{I}"},{"type":"text","value":"甲、乙系统动量守恒，最终共速，----1分则"},{"type":"math","value":"0.5\\mathrm{mv}_0 = 1.5\\mathrm{mv}_1"},{"type":"text","value":"----1分解得共速时"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1} = 1m / s"},{"type":"text","value":"对乙根据动量定理有"},{"type":"math","value":"\\sum 2\\mathrm{LB}\\cos 60^{\\circ}\\mathrm{I}\\Delta t = \\mathrm{mv}_{1}"},{"type":"text","value":"----1分又"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathbf{q} = \\sum \\mathrm{I}\\Delta t"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"q = 10C"},{"type":"text","value":"----1分（3）由能量守恒得"},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{mv_0^2}{4}-\\frac{3mv_1^2}{4}=Q_{\\text{总}}"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"Q_\\text{总} = 0.6J"},{"type":"text","value":"----1分\n（4）乙棒沿右侧倾斜导轨做匀减速直线运动。"},{"type":"math","value":"mg\\sin30^{\\circ}+5B\\cdot i\\cdot2L=ma"},{"type":"text","value":"----1分"},{"type":"math","value":"i=\\frac{\\Delta q}{\\Delta t}=\\frac{C\\cdot\\Delta U}{\\Delta t}=\\frac{C\\cdot5B\\cdot2L\\cdot\\Delta v}{\\Delta t}"},{"type":"text","value":"----1分\n由以上式解得"},{"type":"math","value":"a = 6m/s^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"----1 分\n乙棒上滑的最大距离为 x，"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{1}^{2}=2ax"},{"type":"text","value":"，解得"},{"type":"math","value":"x=\\frac{1}{12}m"},{"type":"text","value":"。----1 分"}]}},{"id":"zj-25-erkao--beidouxingmeng-2505-q18","paper_id":"zj-25-erkao--beidouxingmeng-2505","source_question_id":"beidouxingmeng-2505-q18","number":"18","order":18,"type":"计算题","topics":["电学","力学"],"answer_status":"source","fingerprint":"61f814c06792cd69f3020fcf31a1988115dc56b572db326cff65ee1ca0a07ffe","body":[{"type":"text","value":"18.（13分）某创新小组设计了一个粒子探测器。如图所示，在 "},{"type":"math","value":"xOy"},{"type":"text","value":" 平面内第一象限的虚线与 "},{"type":"math","value":"y"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴所围区域内有一个场强大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"E_{1} = \\frac{3mv_{0}^{2}}{2qL}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、方向平行于 "},{"type":"math","value":"y"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴的匀强电场；第三象限内存在垂直 "},{"type":"math","value":"xOy"},{"type":"text","value":" 平面向外，磁感应强度大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{1} = \\frac{6mv_{0}}{qd}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的匀强磁场；在电场边界右侧放置长为 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\frac{7\\pi L}{6} +\\frac{\\sqrt{3}L}{2}"},{"type":"text","value":" 、高为 "},{"type":"math","value":"3L"},{"type":"text","value":" 的容器（左侧为网状不影响粒子进入，右侧为收集板），容器内分布着正交电磁场，其中匀强磁场方向垂直 "},{"type":"math","value":"xOy"},{"type":"text","value":" 平面向里，磁感应强度大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"B_{2} = \\frac{2mv_{0}}{qL}"},{"type":"text","value":" ，匀强电场方向竖直向下，场强大小为 "},{"type":"math","value":"E_{2} = \\frac{2mv_{0}^{2}}{qL}"},{"type":"text","value":" 。点 "},{"type":"math","value":"P(0, - d)"},{"type":"text","value":" （ "},{"type":"math","value":"d > 0"},{"type":"text","value":" ）处有一粒子源，某一瞬间向第三象限与 "},{"type":"math","value":"y"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴正方向成 "},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":" 角（"},{"type":"math","value":"30^{\\circ}\\leq \\theta\\leq 90^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":"） ，在该角度范围内发射了 "},{"type":"math","value":"N"},{"type":"text","value":" 个电荷量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"q"},{"type":"text","value":" 、质量为 "},{"type":"math","value":"m"},{"type":"text","value":" 的带正电粒子。所有粒子的速度方向均在 "},{"type":"math","value":"xOy"},{"type":"text","value":" 平面内，且粒子数随角度均匀分布；所有射出的粒子均能通过坐标原点 "},{"type":"math","value":"O"},{"type":"text","value":" ，粒子经电场再进入容器，若碰到右侧收集板即被吸收，不计粒子间的相互作用及粒子的重力。求：\n（1）粒子由 P 点射出时水平分速度 "},{"type":"math","value":"v_{x}"},{"type":"text","value":" 的大小；\n（2）要使所有粒子经过匀强电场后均能沿 "},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":" 轴正方向运动，试判断电场方向并写出此虚线的方程；\n（3）在满足（2）的条件下，能进入容器的粒子占总粒子数的百分比；\n（4）在满足（2）的条件下，右侧收集板因吸收粒子而在水平方向上受到的平均作用力。\n"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/f49a7c176dff961cd6fb15b48453180fee255ad1c2b329b957f4aa51cc723548.png","width":840,"height":438,"width_mm":98.778,"row_group":"beidouxingmeng-2505-q18-row1"}],"choices":[],"answer":{"status":"source","key":null,"body":[{"type":"text","value":"18. （1）设从 P 点射出的一粒子，其速度大小为 v ，方向与 y 轴正方向成"},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":"角。"},{"type":"math","value":"d = 2r \\sin \\theta = \\frac{2mv_{x}}{qB_{1}}"},{"type":"text","value":"----1 分\n可得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{x} = 3v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"，即从 P 点射出的粒子其平行于 x 轴的分速度大小是"},{"type":"math","value":"3v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"。----1 分\n（2）电场方向沿 y 轴负方向。----1 分\n粒子到达"},{"type":"math","value":"O"},{"type":"text","value":"点后分布在与"},{"type":"math","value":"x"},{"type":"text","value":"轴正方向成"},{"type":"math","value":"60^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":"的范围内。\n电场区域的边界为从 O 点进入电场的粒子经电场偏转后速度平行于 x 轴正方向时的出点的集合。令出点的坐标为"},{"type":"math","value":"(x, y)"},{"type":"text","value":"，有"},{"type":"math","value":"x = v_{x} t"},{"type":"math","value":"y = \\frac{1}{2} \\frac{q E_{1}}{m} t^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"----1 分消去 t 得"},{"type":"math","value":"y = \\frac{1}{12 L} x^{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"----1 分\n（3）若粒子恰能水平进入探测器，即竖直减速为零位移等于探测器高度"},{"type":"math","value":"y = \\frac{v_y^2}{2a} = 3L"},{"type":"text","value":"……1分\n其中"},{"type":"math","value":"a = \\frac{qE_{1}}{m}"},{"type":"text","value":"，解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{y} = 3v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"——1 分\n即当粒子发射方向与 y 轴正方向成"},{"type":"math","value":"45^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":"至"},{"type":"math","value":"90^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":"角的范围内能进入探测器所占比例为"},{"type":"math","value":"\\eta = \\frac{45^{\\circ}}{60^{\\circ}} = 75\\%"},{"type":"text","value":"----1 分\n（4）粒子以大小为"},{"type":"math","value":"3v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"的水平速度进入电磁场，为抵消粒子所受的电场力，需给粒子一个水平向右的速度"},{"type":"math","value":"\\mathbf{v}_0"},{"type":"text","value":"，粒子在探测器中的运动可以看成匀速直线运动和圆周运动的合运动。其圆周半径"},{"type":"math","value":"R = \\frac{2mv_0}{qB_2} = L"},{"type":"text","value":"，即离x轴高L的粒子恰能与上边界相切\n根据"},{"type":"math","value":"y = \\frac{v_y^2}{2a} = L"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{y} = \\sqrt{3} v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"，即粒子发射方向与"},{"type":"math","value":"y"},{"type":"text","value":"轴正方向成"},{"type":"math","value":"60^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":"至"},{"type":"math","value":"90^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":"角的范围内能达到右边收集板\n收集粒子数"},{"type":"math","value":"n=\\frac{1}{2}N"},{"type":"text","value":"----1分\n作用时间"},{"type":"math","value":"\\Delta t = \\frac{T_1}{2} -\\frac{T_1}{3} = \\frac{T_1}{6} = \\frac{\\pi d}{18v_0}"},{"type":"text","value":"1分"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/89d0470ac6371ce31b097eed77aafd564049451417763e6f3eecb42b0eed1eaf.png","width":304,"height":195,"width_mm":38.4},{"type":"text","value":"根据探测器水平长度，假设粒子以"},{"type":"math","value":"v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"匀速向右，则"},{"type":"math","value":"t_{0}=\\frac{x}{v_{0}}=\\frac{7\\pi L}{6v_{0}}+\\frac{\\sqrt{3}L}{2v_{0}}"},{"type":"text","value":"----1 分\n其中圆周周期"},{"type":"math","value":"T_{2}=\\frac{2\\pi m}{qB_{2}}=\\frac{\\pi L}{v_{0}}"},{"type":"figure","src":"images/3e9067ec4830ab350fc84ebb8ee794c13873c7709e7f0233fe28b002819be1f6.png","width":370,"height":240,"width_mm":46.8},{"type":"text","value":"根据"},{"type":"math","value":"T_{2}<t_{0}<\\frac{3}{2}T_{2}"},{"type":"text","value":"，可知"},{"type":"math","value":"x=v_{0}t+L\\sin\\theta"},{"type":"text","value":"，如图所示\n解得"},{"type":"math","value":"t=\\frac{7}{6}T_{2}"},{"type":"math","value":"\\theta=60^{\\circ}"},{"type":"text","value":"----1分\n则撞击瞬间粒子水平速度为"},{"type":"math","value":"2v_{0}\\cos 60^{\\circ} + v_{0} = 2v_{0}"},{"type":"text","value":"由动量定理"},{"type":"math","value":"-F\\cdot\\Delta t=-nm(2v_0)"},{"type":"text","value":"解得"},{"type":"math","value":"F=\\frac{18Nmv_{0}^{2}}{\\pi d}"},{"type":"text","value":"——1 分"}]}}]}
